## Stack and layout

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, GSAP, TypeScript
- Public site is live at https://cvbcoaching.se/: Swedish default routes plus `/en` (see `src/lib/i18n/`)
- Public offer is two entries: `/individuell-coaching` and `/business-coaching` (English equivalents under `/en`). Former specialist routes permanently redirect to business coaching: executive coaching, ledningsgruppscoaching, team coaching, coachande ledarskap.
- `/om-forsa` and `/en/om-forsa` permanently redirect to `/om-oss` and `/en/om-oss`
- `/portal` and `/portal/:path*` permanently redirect to `/cvb-base`
- Coach entry: `/carolina` → `/cvb-base` when a coach session exists. `/coach-login` redirects to `/carolina`. `/logga-in` redirects to `/coach-login`. Unauthenticated `/cvb-base` redirects to `/coach-login`.
- Client portal: `/klient-login` → `/klient`
- Runtime persistence is Supabase (Auth, tables, RLS, Storage, RPCs). Login is Supabase Auth, not a custom session cookie.
- Seed data in `src/lib/portal/data/` is static. It is for unit tests and the domain model, not runtime writes.
- Access layer: `src/lib/portal/repository.ts` (`build*`/`list*` on a snapshot; `get*` reads Supabase via RLS)
- `cvb_demo_state` is readable legacy on some coach views. APIs no longer write it.
- AI: server-only OpenAI in `src/lib/ai/` with context lock in `src/lib/ai/scope.ts`. Primary model is `gpt-5.6` unless `OPENAI_MODEL` overrides it.
- Public booking (P0-A) is shipped: visitor request, pending window, coach accept/decline, email send state. An accepted introductory call is not a coaching client. See `docs/cvb-p0a-public-booking-release.md`.
- Public copy: no prices, packages, fixed programme formats, or unapproved timing claims. See `CONTENT-REVIEW.md`.
- Tests: Vitest under `tests/`

Demo accounts (password from `PORTAL_DEMO_PASSWORD`, otherwise `cvb-demo-2026`):

- Client: `emma@northlinestudio.se` → `/klient`
- Coach: `carolina@cvbcoaching.se` → `/cvb-base` via `/carolina`

Portal data is fictional. Do not introduce real client data.

